factorio-test-data-dir/
# Also ignore the symlink / APS forms of the test data dirs: a trailing-slash
# pattern matches a real directory but NOT a symlink, so a symlinked
# factorio-test-data-dir slips past `factorio-test-data-dir/` and keeps getting
# accidentally committed. Match the bare names too (ci-3yl).
factorio-test-data-dir
aps-test-data-dir
aps-test-data-dir/
# Per-mod scratch data dirs for running a single PoC's suite in isolation
# (env-scanner, cindra, ...). Same symlink caveat as above -> match both forms.
# An auto-checkpoint swept es-test-data-dir in once (ci-6jz); never commit these.
es-test-data-dir
es-test-data-dir/
cindra-test-data-dir
cindra-test-data-dir/
factorio-test-output.json
package-lock.json
mods-bundle/
# Scratch write-data dir for the in-engine orbital render harness
