# Regenerable; never committed (an auto-checkpoint once swept it in, ci-6y9).
.orbit-render/
.orbit-render
# Same, for the in-engine GROUND render harness (scripts/render-mapgen.sh,
# ci-tizx): a throwaway Factorio data dir + worldgen screenshots. Regenerable.
.mapgen-render/
.mapgen-render
# Same, for the in-engine entity render harness (scripts/render-diode.sh).
.diode-render/
.diode-render
# Mods play.sh fetches from the portal (any-planet-start, helmod) are cached
# here so we download each at most once. Never committed.
.play-cache/
# Local Factorio install (./play.sh + test runner). The DLCs + binary live
# here; nothing in this directory should be committed. Ignored both as a real
# directory and as a local symlink to an out-of-repo install.
factorio/
factorio
